=== v8 / A6: A RECEIPT CANNOT BE DROPPED (chain started, never finished) ===
    rpi3 calls identity::verify alone. IdentityReceipt has no 'drop', so a
    transaction that does not hand it on cannot complete.
$ [rpi3] sui client ptb --move-call $PKG_V8::identity::verify @0x2b2b351f1619d115db50ce007625c932ae69e2aee5abe7f80029e615683245e8
